</span>
<span id="A3.I7.i1.p16" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I7.i1.p16.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I7.i1.p16.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">* Explanation of the importance of continued investment in player development and team building for long-term success</span></span>
</span>
