<span id="A3.I7.i1.p18.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I7.i1.p18.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">* Recap of the key takeaways from the Orioles’ spring training</span></span>
</span>
