<span id="A3.I7.i1.p19.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I7.i1.p19.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">* Final thoughts on the importance of spring training and the team’s potential for success in the upcoming season</span></span>
</span>
